stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> Ready: Complete valid read
    Pending --> Unavailable: Rejected rows or failed read
    Ready --> Pending: Refresh
    Unavailable --> Pending: Retry overdue reviews
    Ready --> Recovery: Decision outcome unconfirmed
    Recovery --> Pending: Refresh while outcome unknown
    Recovery --> Ready: Check outcome verifies original decision
    Pending --> Retired: Authorization lost
    Ready --> Retired: Authorization lost
    Recovery --> Retired: Authorization lost
    Unavailable --> Retired: Authorization lost
    Pending --> Disposed: Panel removed
    Ready --> Disposed: Panel removed
    Recovery --> Disposed: Panel removed
    Unavailable --> Disposed: Panel removed
    Retired --> Disposed: Panel removed
    Disposed --> Disposed: Late results ignored
    Retired --> Retired: Late results ignored
    Unavailable --> Recovery: Valid row outcome unconfirmed
    %% never Claim an empty inbox after rejecting a supplied row.
    %% never Render malformed names or late results after retirement or disposal.
